- Relate, RelatedB
  https://github.com/relatedb/relate
  Apache-2.0. Used as an embedded Python library and a persistent graph store.

WorkGraph reuses ideas from the author's earlier MilestonePay project
(milestone and sample-payment UX). No MilestonePay source files or git history
were copied into this repository.

The live deployment follows MilestonePay's architecture for two infrastructure
pieces, rewritten for WorkGraph and disclosed here:

- Vercel Blob snapshots with ETag compare-and-swap and retry for the durable
  graph file.
- PayPal Orders v2 sandbox create, capture, server-side amount/currency/order
  verification, idempotent capture and webhook verification.

The MilestonePay repository was read only as a reference and was not modified.
Any later copied snippet must be disclosed here and in the submission write-up.
